	(text "FIRMWARE PIN MAP (ESP32-S3 SuperMini)\nOLED I2C (SH1107 128x128, addr 0x3C): SDA = GPIO9, SCL = GPIO8, powered from 3V3\nKeypad rows R1-R4 = GPIO 2 3 4 5, columns C1-C4 = GPIO 6 7 13 12 (passive matrix, no diodes)\nPot: wiper = GPIO10 (ADC1_CH9); high leg = GPIO11 driven HIGH; low leg = GND\nAmp I2S: LRC = GPIO1, BCLK = RX (GPIO44), DIN = TX (GPIO43), VIN = 5V. Needs USB CDC On Boot = Enabled\nAll 15 header GPIOs used. Onboard RGB LED: GPIO48" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e141bafb-75d8-40cf-a76f-f703da764635"))
